  "description": "NVDA Looks Way Overextended...😰",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to <strong>StockTok</strong></em>! Many of you know…I DO NOT LIKE <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NVDA&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. Yes, historically, it has performed phenomenally.  But past performance does not guarantee future results. In my <em><strong>opinion</strong></em>, Nvidia is a bloated hog 🐷. Many in our group, and I, shorted this piggy back in November, most people making fairly substantial gains. So is it time to do it again? </p><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p>",
